  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "023eeb5b-4c74-b044-8f9c-2d9af2e50804"],
 ". Three-dimensional coordinates are projected onto the first two \
coordinates and combined by position."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1887620986,ExpressionUUID->"49471c21-88e2-1a4d-ba94-f929950181d5"],

